# Design System

- Orange is reserved exclusively for critical alerts or urgent cases. It must never be used as a decorative color.

- If orange or yellow are used for an alert, they must not be reused elsewhere on the same page.

- Consult the Design System page: `app/design-system/page.tsx`.
- Consult the global style file: `app/globals.css`.

## Global variables and tokens

- Use the existing global variables and design tokens defined in `app/globals.css`.
- Do not repeat the same visual value across several components.
- Do not hard-code colors, spacings, radiuses, text sizes or other values already available as tokens.
- Create a new global variable only when it meets a need that is reusable across several components or pages.
- Any new global variable or new design token must be validated by the developer before being added.